The '''Lumbridge cow field''' is a field containing level 2 [[cow]]s and [[Cow calf|cow calves]]. Located in the north-east of [[Lumbridge]], the field is managed by [[Gillie Groats]], and is part of the larger [[Groats' farm]]. Also present are [[dairy cow]]s, which can be milked if you have a [[bucket]] in your inventory. This is a good place to train either [[Magic]] or [[Ranged]] at a low combat level due to the fact that you can safely kill them from the other side of the fence, and run in to loot between kills. There are 2 other cow fields in Lumbridge: a large pen [[Lumbridge cow field (north)|north]] of the windmill, and a smaller pen that is part of [[Fred's farm]].

This field is a very popular training spot for low levels of both [[free-to-play|free players]] and [[members]] because of the 100% [[cowhide]] drop, as well as raw beef and bones to train [[Cooking]] and [[Prayer]] with, respectively. It is also an extremely good place to train Prayer and Cooking as bones and beef are often left in the rush to collect cow hides. This is also the closest cow field to a bank as well as a [[Tanner]] in [[Al Kharid]], which also makes it crowded.

After completing [[The Ides of Milk]], [[Brutus]] can be fought at the north end of the field.

==Transportation==
The [[cowbell amulet]] can transport you to the middle of the field following the completion of the The Ides of Milk quest.

